---
// 首页留言小卡片：提交后带参数跳到留言板；预览与统计由 src/scripts/site/home.ts 拉取运行时接口。
---

<section class="section" id="guestbook">
  <div class="card grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 p-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10 lg:p-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
          mark_email_unread
        </span>
        时光信箱 · Letterbox
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">
        留下一枚字句，
        <br />
        像向大海投递一只漂流瓶。
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
        若你也恰巧在某个静默的夜晚途经此处，欢迎留下近况、推荐一首近期陪伴你的好歌，或仅仅是一句简单的“见字如面”。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-label-sm text-muted">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
            lock
          </span>
          支持公开或仅博主可见
        </span>
        <span data-stat-reply>回复率读取中…</span>
        <span data-stat-total>来信统计读取中…</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-2 flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-line pt-4">
        <div
          class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-label-sm font-semibold text-on-secondary-container"
          data-preview-avatar
        >
          修
        </div>
        <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="truncate text-label-sm font-medium text-primary" data-preview-name>
              修仙考研人 · 广州
            </span>
            <span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="chip bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant" data-preview-badge>
                示例留言
              </span>
              <span class="meta" data-preview-time>
                今天 14:20
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" data-preview-message>
            “同在二刷《诡秘之主》！酷狗里开着蝰蛇音效听《大鱼》看网文真是一绝。”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form
      class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6 lg:col-span-7 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-10 lg:pt-0"
      id="home-letter-form"
    >
      <input aria-hidden="true" autocomplete="off" class="hidden" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text" />

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <label class="field-label" for="home-name">
            称呼 / 笔名
          </label>
          <input class="field" id="home-name" name="name" placeholder="例：远方的夜行者" type="text" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <label class="field-label" for="home-station">
            常驻城市 / 留声机单曲
          </label>
          <input class="field" id="home-station" name="station" placeholder="例：成都 · 《大鱼》" type="text" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
        <label class="field-label" for="home-message">
          写下你想说的话
        </label>
        <textarea
          class="field resize-none leading-relaxed"
          id="home-message"
          name="message"
          placeholder="说说你今天的夕阳，或是正在翻开的下一页…"
          rows="4"
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-1">
        <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          <input class="h-4 w-4 accent-secondary" id="home-private" name="private" type="checkbox" />
          <span>仅房主可见（悄悄话模式）</span>
        </label>
        <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">
          <span>投递留言</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">
            send
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div
        class="toast-enter hidden items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container px-3 py-2 text-label-sm text-on-secondary-container"
        id="letter-toast"
        role="status"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">
          check_circle
        </span>
        <span>纸飞机已寄出，感谢你把一束微光照进书房。</span>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
